        "title": "Brown the cauliflower first",
        "text": "Heat 2 tbsp of the oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Add the cauliflower in as close to a single layer as you can manage and let it sit undisturbed for 3–4 minutes before stirring. Cook 8 minutes total, until browned in patches. Remove to a plate."
